#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Kadupul Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>注意：</strong>目前所有核心 Kadupul 外掛程式皆尚未重新設計以搭配遠端資料收集器運作。因此，需要直接存取裝置的外掛程式（如 MacTrack 與 HMIB）目前無法搭配遠端資料收集器使用。不過，只要遠端資料收集器處於 <b>'online'</b> 模式，Thold 等外掛程式仍可正常運作。"

#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Kadupul Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use Kadupul's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collector's Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Kadupul Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump its Boost table output back to the Main Kadupul Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>注意：</strong>您目前已登入遠端資料收集器。處於 <b>'online'</b> 模式時，您將能如同登入主 Kadupul 網站般檢視並控制大部分功能。此外，請務必注意遠端資料收集器必須使用 Kadupul 效能加速服務的<b>「隨選更新」(On Demand Updating)</b> 功能，且我們一律建議使用 Spine。當遠端資料收集器處於 <b>'offline'</b> 模式時，遠端資料收集器的網站將僅包含較少資訊；不過它會快取所有更新，直到可連線至主 Kadupul 資料庫與網頁伺服器為止，屆時會將其 Boost 資料表輸出倒回主 Kadupul 資料庫進行更新。"

